Compiler runtime libraries
--------------------------

Firmware is built with ARM GNU Toolchain 13.3.Rel1. The toolchain-supplied
license collection, including runtime library terms and GCC Runtime Library
Exception, is included in binary packages as
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/ARM-GNU-Toolchain.txt. This does not change the main
firmware license.
